  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.flaming_bracer": "烈焰护腕",
  "relics.description.flaming_bracer.description": "古老护甲内的热量响应遗物佩戴者的动作，从手臂迸发出魔法火焰。火焰在冲击瞬间喷发，束缚被击中的目标，并在其脚下直接点燃，迫使敌人留在火焰能造成最大伤害的地方。",
  "relics.description.flaming_bracer.ability.pyroclastic": "火山碎屑",
  "relics.description.flaming_bracer.ability.pyroclastic.description": "每次攻击有%1$s%%的几率释放一阵魔法火焰：目标被麻痹%2$s秒，无法移动或行动，同时在其脚下生成魔法火焰，造成%3$s点伤害并将其点燃。",
  "relics.description.flaming_bracer.ability.pyroclastic.rank_modifier.fire_immunity": "使遗物佩戴者完全免疫魔法火焰伤害。",
  "relics.description.flaming_bracer.ability.pyroclastic.rank_modifier.fire_regeneration": "当遗物佩戴者处于魔法火焰中时，每秒恢复%4$s点生命值。",
  "relics.description.flaming_bracer.ability.pyroclastic.rank_modifier.fire_exploitation": "对站在魔法火焰中的目标造成的伤害提高%5$s%%。",
  "relics.description.flaming_bracer.ability.pyroclastic.experience_source.ability_trigger": "+1 经验值（每次成功触发能力）。",
  "relics.description.flaming_bracer.ability.pyroclastic.experience_source.healing_in_fire": "+1 经验值（每在魔法火焰中治疗一秒）。",
  "relics.description.flaming_bracer.ability.pyroclastic.experience_source.bonus_damage_hit": "+1 经验值（每次带有额外伤害的攻击）。",
