  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.quantum_bubble": "量子泡泡",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.description": "遗物佩戴者周围的空间凝聚成脆弱的泡泡，从飞行路径中截取来袭的投射物。任何被捕获的东西都会静止在扭曲中，直到外壳被破坏。即便速度无形，投射物也无法抵达目标：泡泡将其冻结在静止的瞬间，阻止其运动完成。",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.ability.stasis": "量子化",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.ability.stasis.description": "最多存储%1$s次充能，每%2$s秒恢复一次。当敌方投射物接近佩戴者时，会自动被泡泡捕获并消耗一次充能。",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.ability.stasis.rank_modifier.blinding_burst": "破坏泡泡会释放能量冲击，使%4$s格内的所有目标失明%5$s秒，并使其失去对遗物佩戴者的视线。",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.ability.stasis.rank_modifier.projectile_direction": "泡泡被破坏时，被拦截的投射物会得到强化并转向其原主人。",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.ability.stasis.rank_modifier.bubble_guard": "若佩戴者周围%3$s格内存在至少一个含有捕获投射物的泡泡，则完全抵消所有来袭伤害，之后其中一个泡泡会破裂。",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.ability.stasis.experience_source.projectile_capture": "+1 经验值（每个捕获的投射物）。",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.ability.stasis.experience_source.damage_negated": "+1 经验值（每次完全抵消来袭伤害）。",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.ability.stasis.statistic.projectiles_captured": "泡泡中捕获的投射物",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.ability.stasis.statistic.projectiles_released": "转向的投射物",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.ability.stasis.statistic.damage_negated": "阻挡的来袭伤害",
  "relics.description.quantum_bubble.ability.stasis.statistic.damage_negated_triggers": "完全抵消伤害次数",

  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.staff_of_the_spectral_walker": "幽魂行者之杖",
  "relics.description.staff_of_the_spectral_walker.description": "遗物佩戴者短暂脱离世界的熟悉层面，身体仅留下飘忽的幽灵形态。无论是石头、木头还是金属，障碍物都会失去密度，让佩戴者像烟中的影子一样穿过。",
  "relics.description.staff_of_the_spectral_walker.ability.spectral": "幽魂冲刺",
  "relics.description.staff_of_the_spectral_walker.ability.spectral.description": "激活时，使佩戴者进入幽灵状态，并朝视线方向向前推进，可自由穿过方块。移动期间，附近的方块暂时被幽灵形态替代，不阻碍移动。能力每激活移动一秒消耗一次充能，充能耗尽或移动停止时结束。法杖最多存储%1$s次充能，每%3$s秒恢复一次。",
  "relics.description.staff_of_the_spectral_walker.ability.spectral.rank_modifier.spectral_vision": "能力激活时，%2$s格内的所有实体在障碍物后依然可见。",
  "relics.description.staff_of_the_spectral_walker.ability.spectral.rank_modifier.safe_return": "若能力在佩戴者无法安全站立的位置结束，会自动返回上一个安全位置。",
  "relics.description.staff_of_the_spectral_walker.ability.spectral.rank_modifier.immortality": "能力激活期间，佩戴者获得不朽效果。",
  "relics.description.staff_of_the_spectral_walker.ability.spectral.experience_source.spectral_time": "+1 经验值（每处于幽灵形态一秒）。",
  "relics.description.staff_of_the_spectral_walker.ability.spectral.statistic.ability_uses": "法杖激活次数",
  "relics.description.staff_of_the_spectral_walker.ability.spectral.statistic.spectral_time": "幽灵形态持续时间",

  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.archmage_glove": "大法师手套",
  "relics.description.archmage_glove.description": "释放的法术并不会总是立刻消散：部分结构会缠绕在手套的线缕中，短暂留存。片刻之后，存储的形态重新聚合，仿佛法术又被施展了一次。",
  "relics.description.archmage_glove.ability.multicasted": "回响法术",
  "relics.description.archmage_glove.ability.multicasted.description": "每次施法有%1$s%%的几率启动多重施法链，法术自动重复最多%2$s次。重复触发依次进行，短暂延迟后完全再现原始法术效果，包括伤害、目标和行为。",
  "relics.description.archmage_glove.ability.multicasted.rank_modifier.multicast_resistance": "当多重施法链激活且下一次触发待定时，佩戴者所受伤害降低%3$s%%。",
  "relics.description.archmage_glove.ability.multicasted.rank_modifier.adaptive_multicast": "每次多重施法失败时，下一次触发的几率提高%4$s%%。成功触发多重施法后，该加成重置。",
  "relics.description.archmage_glove.ability.multicasted.rank_modifier.mana_refund": "每次额外的多重施法触发有%5$s%%的几率返还法术基础消耗的%6$s%%作为法力。",
  "relics.description.archmage_glove.ability.multicasted.experience_source.multicast_trigger": "+1 经验值（每次额外的多重施法触发）。",
  "relics.description.archmage_glove.ability.multicasted.statistic.triggers": "多重施法触发次数",
  "relics.description.archmage_glove.ability.multicasted.statistic.extra_casts": "额外触发次数",
  "relics.description.archmage_glove.ability.multicasted.statistic.blocked_damage": "格挡的伤害",
  "relics.description.archmage_glove.ability.multicasted.statistic.mana_restored": "恢复的法力",
