  "relics.description.emblem_of_assault.ability.onslaught.rank_modifier.vampiric_burst": "每次能力触发使遗物佩戴者恢复%3$s点生命值。",
  "relics.description.emblem_of_assault.ability.onslaught.rank_modifier.war_frenzy": "能力触发后，在%4$s秒内使遗物佩戴者造成的伤害提高%5$s%%。",
