  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.mana_ring": "法力戒指",
  "relics.description.mana_ring.description": "遗物佩戴者的内在储备得到扩展，能够容纳更多法力并更快恢复失去的力量。",
  "relics.description.mana_ring.ability.resonance": "奥术储备",
  "relics.description.mana_ring.ability.resonance.description": "使遗物佩戴者的最大法力提高%1$s%%。",
  "relics.description.mana_ring.ability.resonance.rank_modifier.mana_regen": "使遗物佩戴者的法力再生速度提高%2$s%%。",
  "relics.description.mana_ring.ability.resonance.rank_modifier.healing_to_mana": "当遗物佩戴者恢复生命时，每恢复1点生命同时恢复%3$s点法力。",
  "relics.description.mana_ring.ability.resonance.rank_modifier.mana_debt": "允许法力不足时使用法术，借用缺失的部分。借用的消耗部分增加%4$s%%，并以与正常法力再生相同的速度和条件偿还。",
