  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.ring_of_thrift": "节俭戒指",
  "relics.description.ring_of_thrift.description": "遗物佩戴者的奥术流变得更加平稳，每次施法损失的力量更少。部分消耗的法力不会消散得无影无踪，而是滞留在导电路中，片刻之后便会回归。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_thrift.ability.thrift": "法力节约",
  "relics.description.ring_of_thrift.ability.thrift.description": "使遗物佩戴者的法力消耗降低%1$s%%。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_thrift.ability.thrift.rank_modifier.delayed_refund": "%2$s%%的消耗法力会在%3$s秒后返还。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_thrift.ability.thrift.rank_modifier.casting_momentum": "每次连续施法使遗物佩戴者的法力再生速度提高%5$s%%，持续%4$s秒，效果可叠加最多%6$s层。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_thrift.ability.thrift.rank_modifier.free_cast": "施法时有%7$s%%的几率不消耗法力。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_thrift.ability.thrift.experience_source.mana_refunded": "+1 经验值（每点通过延迟返还返回的法力）。",
