  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.architects_staff": "建筑师之杖",
  "relics.description.architects_staff.description": "在两个标记点之间，会形成由召唤方块构成的临时砖石结构。它不会持续太久，但足够坚固，能承载遗物佩戴者的脚步并连接断裂的道路。",
  "relics.description.architects_staff.ability.bridgecraft": "奥术砖石",
  "relics.description.architects_staff.ability.bridgecraft.description": "最多存储%1$s次充能，每%2$s秒恢复一次。创建桥的最大长度为%3$s个方块。按住右键标记第一个点，松开标记第二个点，随后在两点之间创建由召唤方块构成的桥，持续%4$s秒。每单位桥长消耗1次充能。",
  "relics.description.architects_staff.ability.bridgecraft.rank_modifier.vital_support": "当遗物佩戴者站在桥上时，所受治疗的效果提高%5$s%%。",
  "relics.description.architects_staff.ability.bridgecraft.rank_modifier.ballistic_support": "当遗物佩戴者站在桥上时，其投射物伤害提高%6$s%%。",
  "relics.description.architects_staff.ability.bridgecraft.rank_modifier.disappearance": "当遗物佩戴者站在桥上时，获得消失效果。与世界进行的任何互动都会使其从效果中脱离%7$s秒。",
  "relics.description.architects_staff.ability.bridgecraft.experience_source.bridge_created": "+1 经验值（每次成功创建桥）。",
  "relics.description.architects_staff.ability.bridgecraft.experience_source.bridge_block_created": "+1 经验值（每个创建的桥方块）。",
