  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.illusionists_mantle": "幻术师披肩",
  "relics.description.illusionists_mantle.description": "来袭的一击分裂成虚假影像，在攻击者身旁留下一个令其疑惑和失误的新目标。幻象将注意力从遗物佩戴者的真实身体上引开，扰乱敌人对目标的选择。附近这样的镜像越多，敌人的攻击就越难找到正确的方向。",
  "relics.description.illusionists_mantle.ability.deception": "迷惑反击",
  "relics.description.illusionists_mantle.ability.deception.description": "当遗物佩戴者受到伤害时，有%1$s%%的几率在攻击目标身后创造一道幻象，持续%2$s秒。",
  "relics.description.illusionists_mantle.ability.deception.rank_modifier.illusion_barrier": "佩戴者周围%3$s格内，每有一个佩戴者的幻象，所受伤害降低%4$s%%。",
  "relics.description.illusionists_mantle.ability.deception.rank_modifier.paralyzing_revenge": "破坏遗物佩戴者的幻象会使与其关联的目标麻痹%5$s秒。",
  "relics.description.illusionists_mantle.ability.deception.rank_modifier.fatal_exchange": "受到致命伤害时，将遗物佩戴者转移到其最近的幻象。在受到伤害的位置出现一道新幻象并立即死亡，被选中的幻象消失。",
  "relics.description.illusionists_mantle.ability.deception.experience_source.illusion_spawned": "+1 经验值（每次创造幻象）。",
  "relics.description.illusionists_mantle.ability.deception.experience_source.damage_reduced": "+1 经验值（每点因幻象而降低的伤害）。",
  "relics.description.illusionists_mantle.ability.deception.experience_source.illusion_killed": "+1 经验值（每次因幻象被破坏而触发麻痹）。",
  "relics.description.illusionists_mantle.ability.deception.experience_source.fatal_saved": "+1 经验值（每次通过与幻象交换避免死亡）。",
