  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.spiked_cloak": "尖刺斗篷",
  "relics.description.spiked_cloak.description": "沉重的打击唤醒了遗物织物中的活体尖刺，它们从佩戴者身上向四面八方飞散。每一片释放的碎片都会刺入目标，对其造成伤害并阻碍其行动。",
  "relics.description.spiked_cloak.ability.thorn_burst": "荆棘爆发",
  "relics.description.spiked_cloak.ability.thorn_burst.description": "若遗物佩戴者所受伤害超过其最大生命值的%1$s%%，则有%2$s%%的几率向不同方向释放最多%3$s枚尖刺。每枚尖刺造成%4$s点伤害并施加缓慢III效果，持续5秒。",
  "relics.description.spiked_cloak.ability.thorn_burst.rank_modifier.bleeding_spikes": "尖刺击中使目标获得%5$s级流血效果，持续%6$s秒。",
  "relics.description.spiked_cloak.ability.thorn_burst.rank_modifier.guardian_resilience": "能力触发后，在%8$s秒内使遗物佩戴者所受伤害降低%7$s%%。",
  "relics.description.spiked_cloak.ability.thorn_burst.rank_modifier.spike_bloom": "尖刺击中时有%9$s%%的几率再次释放最多%10$s枚尖刺。",
  "relics.description.spiked_cloak.ability.thorn_burst.experience_source.burst_trigger": "+1 经验值（每次尖刺爆发触发）。",
