  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.ring_of_last_will": "临终遗愿之戒",
  "relics.description.ring_of_last_will.description": "致命一击在遗物中留下了一个瞬间的痕迹，仍可倒回。遗物佩戴者不会死亡，而是回到几秒前的过去，回到身体尚未倒下的时刻。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_last_will.ability.last_will": "临终遗愿",
  "relics.description.ring_of_last_will.ability.last_will.description": "受到致命伤害时，将遗物佩戴者送回3秒之前。该能力进入冷却，只能在%4$s秒后再次触发。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_last_will.ability.last_will.rank_modifier.vengeful_strike": "对造成致命伤害的目标的下一次攻击，伤害提高%1$s%%。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_last_will.ability.last_will.rank_modifier.death_paralysis": "造成致命伤害的目标被麻痹%2$s秒。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_last_will.ability.last_will.rank_modifier.immortal_aftershock": "能力触发后，遗物佩戴者获得不朽效果，持续%3$s秒。",
