  "relics.description.ring_of_last_will.synergy.illusionary_rewind": "幻象痕迹",
  "relics.description.ring_of_last_will.synergy.illusionary_rewind.description": "在时间倒回期间，在起始点留下一个幻象，强制%1$s格范围内的目标只攻击幻象，并在整个倒回持续时间内使遗物佩戴者获得消失效果。",

  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.wing_of_the_wild_stalker": "荒野追猎者之翼",
  "relics.description.wing_of_the_wild_stalker.description": "空气托起遗物佩戴者，让其像鞘翅一样短暂飞行。飞行很快转为下降，但足以争取时间调整位置、逃离追击或从上方攻击目标。",
  "relics.description.wing_of_the_wild_stalker.ability.wild_flight": "掠食飞行",
  "relics.description.wing_of_the_wild_stalker.ability.wild_flight.description": "允许像鞘翅一样飞行，时长最多%1$s秒，之后遗物佩戴者被迫下降。",
  "relics.description.wing_of_the_wild_stalker.ability.wild_flight.rank_modifier.flight_guard": "飞行时，遗物佩戴者所受伤害降低%2$s%%。",
  "relics.description.wing_of_the_wild_stalker.ability.wild_flight.rank_modifier.predator_strike": "遗物佩戴者在飞行时发动的攻击，伤害提高%3$s%%。",
  "relics.description.wing_of_the_wild_stalker.ability.wild_flight.rank_modifier.aerial_dash": "飞行时双击跳跃键可向前猛冲，冲力%4$s。能力冷却%5$s秒。",
