  "relics.description.whirling_broom.synergy.storm_flight.disabled.description": "协同效果已禁用，不提供任何加成。",

  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.ballistarian_bracer": "弹射护腕",
  "relics.description.ballistarian_bracer.description": "一旦投射物离开弓弦、手掌或附魔法杖，便会有奥术轨迹紧随其后，从中诞生幻影复制品。它们跟随着主射击，增强其威力，将单一投射物变成短暂的幽灵齐射。",
  "relics.description.ballistarian_bracer.ability.ballistary": "幽灵齐射",
  "relics.description.ballistarian_bracer.ability.ballistary.description": "发射任何投射物时，有%1$s%%的几率额外发射最多%2$s个投射物。每次触发使主投射物的伤害提高%3$s点。",
  "relics.description.ballistarian_bracer.ability.ballistary.rank_modifier.absorbing_kills": "每次用投射物击杀使遗物佩戴者获得%4$s点吸收值，最多累计%5$s点。",
  "relics.description.ballistarian_bracer.ability.ballistary.rank_modifier.multicast_duplication": "每个投射物击中时，每个幻影投射物有%6$s%%的几率将造成的伤害复制给%7$s格范围内的目标，额外目标数量等于幻影投射物数量。",
  "relics.description.ballistarian_bracer.ability.ballistary.rank_modifier.paralyzing_shots": "被投射物击中的目标每有一个幻影投射物，便会眩晕%8$s秒。",
  "relics.description.ballistarian_bracer.ability.ballistary.experience_source.volley_release": "+1 经验值（每个发射的幻影投射物）。",
  "relics.description.ballistarian_bracer.ability.ballistary.experience_source.volley_hit": "+1 经验值（每次幻影伤害触发）。",
  "relics.description.ballistarian_bracer.ability.ballistary.statistic.phantom_projectiles_released": "发射的幻影投射物",
