  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.horn_of_the_wild_hunter": "荒野猎手号角",
  "relics.description.horn_of_the_wild_hunter.description": "号角悠长的呼声穿过空气，召唤出听命于遗物佩戴者意志的幽灵狼踏上猎踪。它们出现在主人身旁，扑向敌人，不知恐惧、不受伤害地持续撕咬猎物。",
  "relics.description.horn_of_the_wild_hunter.ability.summoner": "狼群呼唤",
  "relics.description.horn_of_the_wild_hunter.ability.summoner.description": "召唤最多%1$s只无敌的狼，为遗物佩戴者而战。每只狼造成%2$s点伤害。",
  "relics.description.horn_of_the_wild_hunter.ability.summoner.rank_modifier.bone_harvest": "被狼击杀的目标有%3$s%%的几率掉落最多%4$s根骨头。",
  "relics.description.horn_of_the_wild_hunter.ability.summoner.rank_modifier.bleeding_bite": "每次狼咬使目标获得%5$s级流血效果，持续%6$s秒。",
  "relics.description.horn_of_the_wild_hunter.ability.summoner.rank_modifier.pack_growth": "每击杀一个目标，有%7$s%%的几率额外召唤1只狼，持续%8$s秒。此类狼的总数不能超过%9$s。",

  "item.reliquified_ars_nouveau.whirlisprig_petals": "旋花仙灵花瓣",
  "relics.description.whirlisprig_petals.description": "轻盈的花瓣漩涡托起遗物佩戴者的动作，帮助其猛烈升空并在空中保持平衡。",
